Smart Caching
Built-in cache with adaptive TTL and automatic invalidation:
const db = database({
schemas: [users],
database: "sqlite",
connection: { filename: "./data.db" },
cache: {
enabled: true,
ttl: 60000, // Base TTL: 60 seconds
